  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific: EU-Pacific Business Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with the EU Delegation to Fiji, ITC is organizing the EU-Pacific Business Forum with the objective of contributing to increased investments and trade between the European Union and the Pacific region. The organization of the Forum will provide opportunities to deepen and operationalize engagement between the EU and the Pacific region in key sectors of economic, trade, and investment cooperation. The Forum will also present a unique opportunity to boost intra-regional economic and trade relations among Pacific countries and territories.</narrative>
  </description>
